<title>NETHERLANDS: PAKHOED DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>PAKHOED DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipping and tank storage group Koninklijke Pakhoed said on Wednesday it had set its 1996 optional stock dividend at one new share per 33 held.</p>
<p>In March, Pakhoed announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 1.80 guilders, unchanged from the 1995 payment. The 1996 payment could be taken up in cash or as an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Pakhoed shares closed at 59.80 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Wednesday, up 0.50 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
